<script lang="ts">let {data,form}=$props();const date=(d:Date)=>new Date(d).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'});</script><svelte:head><title>账号安全 · 站长工作台</title></svelte:head><main><h1>账号安全</h1>{#if form?.error}<p role="alert">{form.error}</p>{/if}{#if form?.success}<p role="status">{form.success}</p>{/if}<h2>重新认证</h2><p>最近认证于 {date(data.reauthenticatedAt)}；敏感操作要求 10 分钟内认证。</p><form method="post" action="?/reauthenticate"><label>当前密码<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required/></label><button>重新认证</button></form><h2>修改密码</h2><form method="post" action="?/password"><label>新密码<input type="password" name="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required/></label><label>确认新密码<input type="password" name="confirm" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" required/></label><button>修改密码并撤销其他会话</button></form><h2>GitHub 登录</h2><p>{data.user.github_numeric_id?`已绑定 ID ${data.user.github_numeric_id}`:'尚未绑定'}</p>{#if data.user.github_numeric_id}<form method="post" action="?/unbind"><button>解绑 GitHub</button></form>{:else if data.githubConfigured}<form method="post" action="?/bind"><button>绑定配置的 GitHub 账号</button></form>{:else}<p>未配置 GitHub OAuth；密码登录可继续使用。</p>{/if}<h2>最近会话</h2><ul>{#each data.sessions as session}<li><p>{session.id===data.currentId?'当前会话':'其他会话'} · 创建于 {date(session.created_at)} · 最近活动 {date(session.last_seen_at)} · {session.revoked_at?'已撤销':'未撤销'}</p>{#if !session.revoked_at&&session.id!==data.currentId}<form method="post" action="?/revoke"><input type="hidden" name="id" value={session.id}/><button>撤销此会话</button></form>{/if}</li>{/each}</ul><h2>最近安全事件</h2><ul>{#each data.events as event}<li>{event.action} · {date(event.created_at)}</li>{/each}</ul></main><style>form{max-width:600px;margin-block:20px}h2{margin-top:36px}li{padding-block:12px}</style>
